pretty easy challenge 

we are simply provided with a link which opens a website which displays a gif which changes with our mouse movement 

then i copy the link and use wget to downlod the image 

then i look at the image and its .png so i try to use zsteg on it but get an error saying its too big and can't do anything 

so i googled and found a way to compress the image 

using this command below i was able to compress the image 

pngcrush -rem alla -reduce -brute concat_v.png fixed.png

and then once it was compressed i ran zsteg on the fixed.png 

and boom got the flag 

